WEBVTT

54:01.056 --> 54:04.017
came into my house as a guest

54:04.142 --> 54:08.021
and there conspired
to murder my son.

54:08.897 --> 54:11.399
A boy of 10.

54:13.109 --> 54:16.321
In the name of King Robert
and the good lords you serve,

54:16.446 --> 54:19.241
I call upon you to seize him

54:19.991 --> 54:22.744
and help me return him to Winterfell

54:22.869 --> 54:25.163
to await the king's justice.
